00:33:16,359 --> 00:33:21,784
other time frame participants to respond and hop onto the trend or counter it.

454
00:33:22,584 --> 00:33:32,084
This countering eventually causes an imbalance in positions and prices and it eventually results in a seemingly aggressive price response.

455
00:33:32,084 --> 00:33:35,343
So note, when we have this imbalance, we

456
00:33:35,343 --> 00:33:38,602
get the initiative, that change in price, that

457
00:33:38,602 --> 00:33:43,083
aggressive change in price brings other time frame participants into play.

