00:34:00,368 --> 00:34:04,305
Now remember what we said, a normal distribution is where

462
00:34:04,305 --> 00:34:08,242
buyers initiate and are responsive at lows of the range

463
00:34:08,242 --> 00:34:12,967
and sellers initiate and are responsive at the high of the range.

464
00:34:13,468 --> 00:34:17,110
So by this very token, when the market is distributing,

465
00:34:17,110 --> 00:34:19,660
we can see that the odds are

