00:35:31,268 --> 00:35:36,668
Short covering is where the shorts cover their positions by buying out of those positions.

483
00:35:36,668 --> 00:35:43,968
Now note, initiative selling, so shorts, they run into strong responsive long time frame buyers.

484
00:35:44,668 --> 00:35:48,868
These buyers are responding to lower prices being advertised.

