00:36:21,068 --> 00:36:26,868
In the B distribution, buyers this time, they run into aggressive initiative sellers.

492
00:36:26,968 --> 00:36:34,268
So we have longs in the market, they keep buying higher prices until they run into very strong responsive sellers.

493
00:36:34,968 --> 00:36:37,768
Those responsive sellers keep selling and eventually

494
00:36:37,768 --> 00:36:40,568
the buyers are forced to liquidate their

495
00:36:40,568 --> 00:36:43,368
longs by selling out of their position.

496
00:36:43,768 --> 00:36:47,768
This takes prices further lower until such a point that

497
00:36:48,368 --> 00:36:55,168
the longer time time frame buyers respond to relatively cheaper prices.

498
00:36:55,568 --> 00:36:59,768
This then stabilizes the market and we see further two-way trade.

