01:13:09,156 --> 01:13:12,289
Now the reason it's slightly less dynamic is because what

965
01:13:12,289 --> 01:13:16,049
we saw with the first two day types, when we have a

966
01:13:16,049 --> 01:13:18,242
normal day type, we know that there's

967
01:13:18,242 --> 01:13:20,435
a high probability that the market is

968
01:13:20,435 --> 01:13:23,254
going to spend the day within the initial range.

