01:13:23,556 --> 01:13:30,656
When we have a neutral day, we know there's a high probability that the market's likely to extend on both sides of the initial range.

970
01:13:31,056 --> 01:13:38,154
Whereas with a normal variation day, we know there's a high probability for extension, but we're not sure in which direction.

971
01:13:38,556 --> 01:13:46,554
So it's important that we wait for these bigger time frames to make their move before then placing our trade strategies.

