01:14:31,056 --> 01:14:36,156
where we have lots of little profiles or areas being accepted over a period of a day.

981
01:14:36,456 --> 01:14:38,256
Remember what we said in a traditional

982
01:14:38,456 --> 01:14:45,556
trend day, there's a high level of directional confidence and it tends to be evident over the entire session.

983
01:14:46,456 --> 01:14:52,256
As the market trends, it tends to draw in new business and thus higher and higher volume.

984
01:14:53,156 --> 01:15:00,236
We also tend to see a lot of one time framing as the initiative tends to occur over the entire

985
01:15:00,236 --> 01:15:06,254
