01:15:40,056 --> 01:15:46,256
Now, some of the characteristics is volume dispersion. This is how volume is dispersed over various prices.

995
01:15:46,556 --> 01:15:51,456
As you can see in the example, it tends to be dispersed over a varying number of prices.

996
01:15:51,656 --> 01:15:55,056
And this is very, very characteristic of a trend day.

997
01:15:55,156 --> 01:15:59,556
The market tends to show initiative until it finds responsive other time frames.

998
01:15:59,756 --> 01:16:02,656
We then have a little bit of distribution and then initiative.

999
01:16:02,756 --> 01:16:07,356
And then it runs again into responsive time frame and then again initiative.

1000
01:16:07,356 --> 01:16:11,656
So we tend to... form lots of little value areas over the period of the session.

1001
01:16:13,156 --> 01:16:16,556
Another key characteristic is the low volume areas.

