01:17:11,756 --> 01:17:16,856
And the reason this is an early characteristic is because of the nature of initiative price action.

1014
01:17:17,256 --> 01:17:26,056
Initiative by its very nature is when large time frame participants who are influential are looking to execute quite aggressively.

1015
01:17:26,356 --> 01:17:30,156
When they're executing, they're not too concerned about price.

