1034
01:18:44,856 --> 01:18:51,556
comes into the market, this suddenly creates initiative and it's this initiative that breaks us out of the initial range.

1035
01:18:51,556 --> 01:18:57,656
Now note, it does tend to leave a low volume area or an untraded area of prices.

1036
01:18:58,056 --> 01:19:02,186
This untraded area is crucial in a double distribution day

1037
01:19:02,186 --> 01:19:09,156
as again it gives a little bit of a lean towards one direction. or the other.

